@startuml process_view

actor User
participant "VM Management System" as System
participant VirtualMachine as VM

User -> System : Start virtual machine
System -> VM : Check current status
VM --> System : Return status

alt VM is stopped
    System -> VM : Set status to running
    VM --> System : Status updated
    System --> User : VM started successfully
else VM is already running
    System --> User : VM is already running
end

@enduml